  "hh.seoBody": "A cikin taro {n} da ke bayanan mu, {lead}, tare da kunnen-kunne {draws}. Wasan yana da matsakaicin kwallaye {avg} a kowane wasa — {over}% na wadannan taro sun wuce kwallaye 2.5 kuma kungiyoyin biyu sun zura kwallo a {btts}%. Wasannin da suka wuce ba sa tabbatar da sakamako na gaba, amma suna da amfani wajen tantance farashin kasuwa{soon}.",
