  "home.seo.more": "Karanta ƙari ▾",
  "home.seo.p1": "AI Betting Tips shine tashar baiki mai zaman kansa da tsinkayar wasan jiya da aka gina don masu baiki da ke son riba da bada ta bayani, ba ta kava. Kowe zaɓi an jawo shi ne daga halin bakin kasuwa: mun cire karami don samun darajar kai tsaye, sannan mun nuna zaɓuki inda mafi kyau sako yajiya darajar laini.",
  "home.seo.p2": "Ba kamar yawancin sitin masu baiki, baiki kowane da muka buga ana ajiye shi a lokacin da ya taso kuma aka raba shi atomatik kan ƙarƙashin ƙarshe. Win rate, ROI da kiɗar riba da ka ga akan babaita aikin mu an ƙaddara su ne daga baiki da aka ƙaddara — babu wanda aka rubutu ha basu, kuma raɗaɗin yin rashin nasara ba sa sallama a hankali.",
  "home.seo.p3": "Babaita namu ana ƙaddara kowane abokin cinikin jiya a inganci darajar, zuwani kasuwa, saurin biyan kuɗi, app mobail, ɓataɓatagin baiki da tallafi. Rajajiyan suna biyowa jiya. Babaita an tsada su ta kasuwa don ka lesteta nisan saitin sakandare don kasar ku.",
  "home.seo.p4": "Waje ya kamata koyaushe ya zama kusada, ba hanya don yin kuɗi ko chasing kasua. Tsinkayar baiki namu shine tunanin ƙididdiga, ba garantiya. Sai kawai ji baiki wanda za ka iya daidai lahani cikin jiya, sa iyaka, kuma idan baiki ya daina kasancewa da mai kyau, nemi taimako daga gida ta tallafi a kasar ku. Dole ka kasance 18+ don yin baiki.",
  "home.why.f1h": "Rajistar da aka cika",
  "home.why.f1p": "Kowane gasanin aka ajiye kuma aka raba shi kan ainihin sakamakon. Babu zaɓin - win rate da ROI suna fito ne daga gwajin da aka ƙaddara kawai.",
  "home.why.f2h": "Babu kusada likita a bakin kasuwa",
  "home.why.f2p": "Ana ƙaddara abokan cinikin jiya shida kuma suna rajajiyan ta jiya - babu wanda ya saye matsayin sama.",
  "home.why.f3h": "Koyaushe libre",
  "home.why.f3p": "Duk yau da yau duk tsinkayawa, mai kampi da bincike suna kumfa gida. Babu bakin gaida, babu mai tsada upsells.",
